    "created_at": "2025-02-25T17:16:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-25T17:16:48Z",
    "body": "Are you sure the problem doesn't all just boil down to \"[nearest inclusive open popover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#nearest-inclusive-open-popover)\" not including `hint` at step 2.1? The \"[topmost popover ancesor](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#topmost-popover-ancestor)\" algorithm does seem to handle hints, e.g. step 9.4.4.\n\n\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
