    "created_at": "2025-04-23T12:27:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-23T12:27:07Z",
    "body": "On the one hand, it's probably not a good idea for developers to open a modal dialog inside of a hint popover. I imagine that would be quite disruptive. On the other hand, without this provision, should developers do such a thing we'd be back to the same type of issues described in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9998. So I think the change @Gingeh describes is warranted.\n\nThough a small aside; I think Webkit and Firefox pass this WPT due to a lack of support for \"hint\" popovers. So it is perhaps coincidental for them.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
